  m_text: "\tThe player takes control of the last surviving soldier fighting against
    zombies across five different areas. Zombies will constantly chase the player,
    requiring continuous movement, dodging, and efficient ammo management to survive.
    During combat, players can collect gold, ammo boxes, and health packs to upgrade
    their character. Each stage requires eliminating all zombies to summon the Boss,
    and defeating the Boss unlocks the next area."
